---
import Layout from "layouts/LayoutLanding.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Open Source Robotics Stage - GOSIM Paris 2026"
  description="An interactive open stage where attendees can see, touch, and interact with real open-source robots at GOSIM Paris 2026."
  navDarkMode={true}
  navBackground="header-home"
>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero-section">
      <div class="hero-background">
        <div class="hero-gradient"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <span class="badge">GOSIM Paris 2026</span>
          <span class="badge">Interactive &amp; Hands-On</span>
          <span class="badge">Open Source</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">Open Source Robotics Stage</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">See it. Touch it. Build it. The future of robotics is open.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Introduction Section -->
    <section class="intro-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Experience Open Source Robotics Up Close</h2>
        <p class="intro-text">
          The Open Source Robotics Stage is an open arena where attendees can see, touch, and interact with real open-source robots. From walking legs to dexterous hands, robotic arms, and autonomous navigators — experience the cutting edge of open-source robotics firsthand.
        </p>
        <p class="intro-text">
          Many of the robots on display will be interactive, giving you the chance to try them yourself. Alongside the hands-on demos, technical talks will dive deeper into the projects, their architectures, and the open-source communities behind them.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Workshop Category Rows -->
    <section class="categories-section">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Workshop Categories</h2>
        <div class="categories-list">

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #6366f1; --accent-light: #818cf8;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="legs">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🦿</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">01</span>
              <h3>Open Source Legs</h3>
              <p>Humanoid locomotion, walking robots, and legged platforms. Watch open-source bipeds and quadrupeds take their steps — and learn how you can build your own.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #3b82f6; --accent-light: #60a5fa;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="hands">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🤲</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">02</span>
              <h3>Open Source Hands &amp; Grippers</h3>
              <p>Dexterous manipulation, robotic hands, and adaptive grippers. See how open hardware and software combine to give robots a sense of touch and fine motor control.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #10b981; --accent-light: #34d399;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="arms">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🦾</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">03</span>
              <h3>Open Source Arms</h3>
              <p>Robotic arms for teleoperation, manipulation, and automation. From tabletop manipulators to full-size industrial arms — all open source, all hackable.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #f59e0b; --accent-light: #fbbf24;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="navigation">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🧭</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">04</span>
              <h3>Open Source Navigation</h3>
              <p>Autonomous mobile robots, rovers, and self-driving platforms. Explore how open-source stacks power robots that see, map, and navigate the world around them.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #ec4899; --accent-light: #f472b6;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="haptics">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🖐️</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">05</span>
              <h3>Open Source Haptics</h3>
              <p>Touch feedback, tactile sensing, and haptic interfaces. Feel what robots feel — experience the next generation of open-source sensory technology.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #8b5cf6; --accent-light: #a78bfa;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="simulation">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🖥️</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">06</span>
              <h3>Simulation</h3>
              <p>Physics simulation environments for robotics development and testing. See how open-source simulators accelerate robotics research before hardware ever hits the bench.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #06b6d4; --accent-light: #22d3ee;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="companion">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🤖</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">07</span>
              <h3>Companion Robots</h3>
              <p>Social robots, interactive companions, and consumer robotics. Meet friendly open-source robots designed to live alongside people in everyday life.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="category-row" style="--accent: #ef4444; --accent-light: #f87171;">
            <div class="category-scene" data-scene="humanoids">
              <div class="scene-placeholder">
                <span class="scene-icon">🧑</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="category-info">
              <span class="category-number">08</span>
              <h3>Open Source Humanoids</h3>
              <p>Full-body humanoid robots that bring legs, arms, hands, and brains together into one system. From open hardware platforms to imitation learning frameworks — build the complete humanoid stack.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action Section with Video -->
    <section class="cta-video-section">
      <div class="cta-video-background">
        <video
          autoplay
          loop
          muted
          playsinline
          webkit-playsinline
          poster="/videos/paris-hero-bk.jpg"
          onloadstart="this.playbackRate=0.25"
        >
          <source src="/videos/paris-hero-compressed.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
        </video>
        <div class="cta-video-overlay"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-video-content">
        <h2>Interested in Presenting?</h2>
        <p>
          We're looking for open-source robotics projects to showcase on stage — whether it's a live demo, a technical talk, or an interactive workshop. If you're building something exciting in open-source robotics, we'd love to hear from you.
        </p>
        <a href="https://cfp.gosim.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="cta-button">
          Submit a Proposal
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero Section */
  .hero-section {
    position: relative;
    height: 60vh;
    min-height: 500px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .hero-gradient {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a5f 40%, #0e7aff 100%);
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    padding: clamp(20px, 6vw, 64px);
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-badges {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .badge {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.2vw, 60px);
    line-height: 1.08;
    margin: 0.2em 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 20px);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* Common */
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(20px, 5vw, 60px);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: #0f172a;
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* Introduction Section */
  .intro-section {
    padding: 40px 0;
    background: #fff;
  }

  .intro-text {
    color: #516072;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  /* Categories Section */
  .categories-section {
    padding: 60px 0;
    background: #0f172a;
  }

  .categories-section h2 {
    color: #fff;
  }

  .categories-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    border-radius: 20px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .category-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
    transition: background 0.4s ease;
    cursor: default;
  }

  .category-row:hover {
    background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.95);
  }

  /* Scene area — future Three.js container */
  .category-scene {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 180px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 15%, transparent), color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-light) 8%, transparent));
  }

  .scene-placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .scene-icon {
    font-size: 4rem;
    filter: grayscale(0.3);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1), filter 0.4s ease;
  }

  .category-row:hover .scene-icon {
    transform: scale(1.15);
    filter: grayscale(0);
  }

  /* Info area */
  .category-info {
    padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .category-number {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent-light);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .category-info h3 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .category-row:hover .category-info h3 {
    color: var(--accent-light);
  }

  .category-info p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 540px;
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .category-row:hover .category-info p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }

  /* CTA Video Section */
  .cta-video-section {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 50vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .cta-video-background {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .cta-video-background video {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .cta-video-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14, 23, 42, 0.9) 0%, rgba(30, 58, 95, 0.75) 50%, rgba(14, 122, 255, 0.6) 100%);
  }

  .cta-video-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    padding: clamp(40px, 8vw, 80px) clamp(20px, 5vw, 60px);
  }

  .cta-video-content h2 {
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .cta-video-content p {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #0e7aff;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 14px 36px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    background: #0b63d1;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-section {
      min-height: 400px;
    }

    .category-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .category-scene {
      min-height: 120px;
    }

    .category-info {
      border-left: none;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
